  'run.howto.beat.p1': 'The ring on the DROP button closes in with the music. Drop on the beat for a discount and to keep your streak. Kills in a row make a combo that boosts coins.',
  'run.howto.beat.title': 'The beat',
  'run.howto.between.p1': 'Spend Records in the Studio for permanent upgrades and new turrets. Open crates for gear, equip it on the Band tab, upgrade it and merge duplicates into higher rarities. Do daily quests and the daily challenge for diamonds.',
  'run.howto.between.title': 'Between runs',
  'run.howto.coins.p1': 'Kills give coins, which buy more drops (each drop costs a bit more). Kills also fill the HYPE bar. When it fills you pick a Remix card, a run-long upgrade. Bosses and chests give Merch relics.',
  'run.howto.coins.title': 'Coins and hype',
  'run.howto.defeat.p1': 'The defeat screen shows what happened: which lane leaked most, which Static got through and a few tips. Press Share to save a picture of your board and show your friends.',
  'run.howto.defeat.title': 'After a defeat',
  'run.howto.diff.p1': 'Each stage has Encore levels. Higher Encores make the Static tougher and pay more Records and Fans. Start at Encore 0, win with 3 stars, then climb. Every stage is a new challenge, so check the hints on the Tour tab.',
  'run.howto.diff.title': 'Difficulty',
  'run.howto.drop.p1': 'Tap DROP to place a random turret. Tap an empty tile first to choose exactly where. Two turrets of the same level can be merged: drag one onto the other, or tap one then the other. Every level doubles the power (up to level 7). Different turrets of the same level can remix into a surprise.',
  'run.howto.drop.title': 'Drop and merge',
  'run.howto.goal.p1': 'The Static walks along the path towards your stage. Stop every one of them. Each one that gets through costs stage health. Survive all the waves, beat the boss and clear the stage for stars.',
  'run.howto.goal.title': 'The goal',
  'run.howto.heroes.p1': 'RoxorLoops and Jasmin each have a special move with a cooldown. Beatbox Blast hits everything. Siren Song slows and heals. Use both within 2 seconds for a Duet Finale.',
  'run.howto.heroes.title': 'Heroes',
  'run.howto.ok': 'Got it',
  'run.howto.preview.p1': 'Before each wave you can see what is coming, including its modifier and any boss. Use the prep time to place the right turrets, such as splash for swarms and heavy hitters for armour.',
  'run.howto.preview.title': 'Wave preview',
  'run.howto.reroll.p1': 'The small box above DROP shows which turret you will get. Do not like it? Tap the re-roll button beside DROP to draw a different one. Re-rolls are limited and get pricier, so save them for the turret you really need.',
  'run.howto.reroll.title': 'Re-roll the next drop',
  'run.howto.syn.p1': 'Turrets help their neighbours. Loop Station and Amp Stack boost the turrets next to them, and some pairs unlock a bonus when they sit side by side. Tap a turret to see what it likes. Plan your board, do not just fill it.',
